<view class="page login"><view class="decor decor-a"></view><view class="decor decor-b"></view><view class="top"><view class="logo">职</view><view class="brand">职寻刷题<text>ZHIXUN CAMPUS</text></view></view><view class="intro"><view class="kicker">WELCOME BACK</view><view class="title">登录后，继续你的<text>成长轨迹。</text></view><view class="muted">一个手机号，保存你的答题记录与专属题库。</view></view><view class="form card"><view class="step"><view class="step-dot active">1</view><view class="step-line {{sent?'active-line':''}}"></view><view class="step-dot {{sent?'active':''}}">2</view><text>{{sent?'输入验证码':'验证手机号'}}</text></view><view class="label">手机号码</view><view class="phone input-shell"><text>+86</text><input type="number" maxlength="11" disabled="{{sent}}" placeholder="请输入 11 位手机号" bindinput="onPhone" value="{{phone}}"/></view><block wx:if="{{sent}}"><view class="label code-label">短信验证码</view><view class="input-shell"><input class="code" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="请输入 6 位验证码" bindinput="onCode" value="{{code}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{developmentCode}}" class="dev"><view class="dev-dot"></view>开发环境已自动填入验证码</view></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="btn submit" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="submit">{{sent?'进入职寻':'获取验证码'}}<text wx:if="{{!loading}}"> →</text></button><view class="agreement">登录即代表你同意服务条款与隐私政策</view></view></view>
